OL,3,GNEWSATraffic wardens to return after 10
OL,4,Ayears to town blighted by illegal
OL,5,Aparking
OL,6,
OL,7,FA council area that has been without
OL,8,Ftraffic wardens for more than a decade
OL,9,Fis hoping to have them back within
OL,10,Fmonths in order to tackle what
OL,11,Fresidents have described as "near
OL,12,Fanarchy" on its streets.
OL,14,FDumfries and Galloway Council (DGC) is
OL,15,Fone of a minority of local authorities
OL,16,Fwhich does not have a Decriminalised
OL,17,FParking Enforcement (DPE) regime in
OL,18,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
