OL,3,GNEWSATraffic wardens to return after 10
OL,4,Ayears to town blighted by illegal
OL,5,Aparking
OL,6,
OL,7,FDumfries, in particular, has faced
OL,8,Frepeated complaints about parking, and
OL,9,Fin June last year the council applied
OL,10,Ffor DPE so it could employ its own
OL,11,Fwardens with powers to issue penalty
OL,12,Fnotices.
OL,14,FOfficials from Transport Scotland have
OL,15,Ftold the local authority the powers to
OL,16,Flevy fines are expected to be in place
OL,17,Fby the end of the year.
